{"id": "REF_001", "split": "dev", "question": "A solicitation under an existing supply arrangement receives a declaration package after close due to courier delay. What is required for Reciprocal Procurement declarations, and when can a late package still be treated as delayed rather than rejected?", "mode": "cross_mode", "question_type": "eligibility_documentation", "source_family_needed": ["buyers_guide"], "expected_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-plan-determine-procurement-strategy-interim-policy-reciprocal-procurement__5e3e4634b7", "buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-receive-and-evaluate-receive-offers-handle-late-or-delayed-offers__797ed5959b"], "gold_relevant_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-plan-determine-procurement-strategy-interim-policy-reciprocal-procurement__5e3e4634b7", "buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-receive-and-evaluate-receive-offers-handle-late-or-delayed-offers__797ed5959b"], "gold_relevant_chunk_ids": [], "claim_evidence": [{"claim": "Reciprocal Procurement declarations are required before contract award.", "evidence_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-plan-determine-procurement-strategy-interim-policy-reciprocal-procurement__5e3e4634b7"]}, {"claim": "Late offers are returned unless they qualify as delayed offers with acceptable evidence of timely submission.", "evidence_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-receive-and-evaluate-receive-offers-handle-late-or-delayed-offers__797ed5959b"]}], "required_claims": ["Reciprocal Procurement declarations are required before contract award.", "Late offers are returned unless they qualify as delayed offers with acceptable evidence of timely submission.", "Buyers may request declarations at closing but cannot require them as mandatory at closing."], "forbidden_claims": ["Declarations can be made mandatory only at offer closing."], "reference_answer": "Reciprocal Procurement declarations must be obtained before contract award, and buyers may request them at closing but cannot make them mandatory at closing. A late submission is normally returned unless it qualifies as a delayed offer with acceptable proof it was sent before closing using the allowed evidence channels.", "expect_abstain": false, "noise_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-create-solicitation-tender-notices-advanced-contract-award-notice__6941c7b148"], "contradiction_doc_prefixes": []}
{"id": "REF_002", "split": "dev", "question": "Before posting or awarding through an ACAN path, what minimum rationale and file records must be in place to support the non-competitive decision?", "mode": "acan", "question_type": "documentation", "source_family_needed": ["buyers_guide"], "expected_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-create-solicitation-tender-notices-advanced-contract-award-notice__6941c7b148"], "gold_relevant_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-create-solicitation-tender-notices-advanced-contract-award-notice__6941c7b148"], "gold_relevant_chunk_ids": [], "claim_evidence": [{"claim": "The file must include rationale for the pre-identified business and the relevant exception to soliciting offers.", "evidence_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-create-solicitation-tender-notices-advanced-contract-award-notice__6941c7b148"]}, {"claim": "The justification for choosing a single known business and approved procurement strategy must be recorded before issuing an ACAN.", "evidence_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-create-solicitation-tender-notices-advanced-contract-award-notice__6941c7b148"]}], "required_claims": ["The file must include rationale for the pre-identified business and the relevant exception to soliciting offers.", "The justification for choosing a single known business and approved procurement strategy must be recorded before issuing an ACAN."], "forbidden_claims": ["ACAN decisions can be left undocumented if urgency exists."], "reference_answer": "For ACAN, the procurement file must document why the pre-identified supplier was chosen, cite the relevant legal/policy exception to solicitation, and include the approved procurement strategy. The single-supplier justification has to be recorded before issuing the ACAN notice.", "expect_abstain": false, "noise_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-plan-determine-procurement-strategy-interim-policy-reciprocal-procurement__5e3e4634b7"], "contradiction_doc_prefixes": []}
{"id": "REF_003", "split": "dev", "question": "Evaluation is running long and the offer acceptance window is about to lapse. What are the allowed options and what is the consequence if award is made after expiry?", "mode": "late_offer", "question_type": "process", "source_family_needed": ["buyers_guide"], "expected_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-receive-and-evaluate-receive-offers-handle-offers__a1b9b21036"], "gold_relevant_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-receive-and-evaluate-receive-offers-handle-offers__a1b9b21036"], "gold_relevant_chunk_ids": [], "claim_evidence": [{"claim": "Canada may request written extensions from all responsive offerors before expiry.", "evidence_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-receive-and-evaluate-receive-offers-handle-offers__a1b9b21036"]}, {"claim": "Contracts awarded after offer expiry are considered sole-source and require justification.", "evidence_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-receive-and-evaluate-receive-offers-handle-offers__a1b9b21036"]}], "required_claims": ["Canada may request written extensions from all responsive offerors before expiry.", "If the offer validity expires before award, the solicitation must be reissued.", "Contracts awarded after offer expiry are considered sole-source and require justification."], "forbidden_claims": [], "reference_answer": "Before expiry, Canada can request a written validity extension from all responsive offerors. If validity expires before award, the solicitation needs to be reissued. If award happens after expiry, it is treated as sole-source and must be justified as such.", "expect_abstain": false, "noise_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-create-solicitation-tender-notices-advanced-contract-award-notice__6941c7b148"], "contradiction_doc_prefixes": []}
{"id": "REF_004", "split": "dev", "question": "At award time, what Integrity Verification Services evidence must be retained in the procurement file?", "mode": "award", "question_type": "documentation", "source_family_needed": ["buyers_guide"], "expected_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-award-award-contract-elements-consider-award__bc84b1b70f"], "gold_relevant_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-award-award-contract-elements-consider-award__bc84b1b70f"], "gold_relevant_chunk_ids": [], "claim_evidence": [{"claim": "Buyers must keep a copy of the IVS confirmation email in the procurement file.", "evidence_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-award-award-contract-elements-consider-award__bc84b1b70f"]}], "required_claims": ["Buyers must keep a copy of the IVS confirmation email in the procurement file.", "Buyers must certify that information provided to IVS is as received from the offeror."], "forbidden_claims": [], "reference_answer": "Before award, IVS checks must be completed and the file should retain the IVS confirmation email. The buyer also certifies that data sent to IVS matches what was received from the offeror.", "expect_abstain": false, "noise_doc_prefixes": ["buyers_guide__en-buyer-s-portal-buyer-s-guide-create-solicitation-tender-notices-advanced-contract-award-notice__6941c7b148"], "contradiction_doc_prefixes": []}
